{
  "title": "Projectile Target Challenge: Pick Angle and Speed",
  "description": "A launcher sits at the left end of a flat green 70 m field with tick marks every 10 m along the ball's line of flight. A blue target disc with a yellow flag sits down the field. Set the launch angle and speed, then press Launch: the red ball flies along its arc and leaves a red trail. The previous shot's arc stays as a faded grey path. Hit targets at 30 m, 45 m and 18 m using no more than 10 launches.",
